## 3. `ObjectRecognitionService.ask()`

It **awaits** the full `post()` response, then yields deltas by parsing the complete `value.body` string. It does **not** stream from the HTTP layer.

```92:117:/Users/jace/Documents/newapp/packages/feature/ai/feature_glasses_object_recognition/lib/src/service/object_recognition_service.dart
  @override
  Stream<ObjectRecognitionDelta> ask({
    required String question,
    required List<String> imageUrls,
    String? sessionId,
  }) async* {
    final result = await _httpClient.post(
      _config.streamUrl,
      headers: _config.headers,
      body: {
        'projectId': _config.projectId,
        'content': question,
        'imageUrls': imageUrls,
        if (sessionId != null && sessionId.isNotEmpty) 'sessionId': sessionId,
        'textLanguageFlag': true,
        'ttsFlag': false,
      },
    );

    switch (result) {
      case Success(:final value):
        yield* _parser.parse(value.body);
      case Failure(:final error):
        throw error;
    }
  }
```

